From b2210da104f4d30346868a8845761d869fff2061 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 05:28:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Weekday drip: 1 exercise per school day, 5 days per week

Drip Day N used to unlock N-1 x 24h after the exact moment of
registration, counting Saturday and Sunday.

- add getDripUnlockMs() in studentAccess.ts: Day 1 unlocks immediately,
  every later day unlocks at 00:00 Cambodia time on the next Mon-Fri
- use it in evaluateExerciseAvailability (start route) and the student
  portal (studentServer.ts) so lock state and unlock countdown agree
- update the admin drip hint text (Khmer) to describe Mon-Fri unlocking
- add TEST 8 to scripts/test-student-access.mjs

No change to grading, answers, choices or payment/expiry rules.
